## Why This Is Asked
This question probes multi-region, low-latency feature-flag design with per-tenant isolation and real-time updates.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant data modeling in Cosmos DB with tenantId partition key
- Regional caching with Redis and cache invalidation via Change Feed
- GraphQL gateway design for low-latency reads
- Progressive delivery and rollback strategies across environments
- Observability and fault-tolerance

## Code Example
```javascript
async function getFlag(tenantId, key){
  const cacheKey = `${tenantId}:${key}`;
  let v = await redis.get(cacheKey);
  if (v) return JSON.parse(v);
  const doc = await cosmos.findFlag(tenantId, key);
  await redis.set(cacheKey, JSON.stringify(doc), 'EX', 1);
  return doc;
}
```

